## Reference

- Scaffold script: `${CLAUDE_SKILL_DIR}/scripts/scaffold.py` (symlink → `~/Journal/.seed/scaffold.py`)
- Shell version: `~/Journal/.seed/init.sh` (supports same `--headless` flags)
- Seed base: `~/Journal/.seed/base/`
- Projects dir: `~/Journal/.claude-projects/`
- Symlink chain: `workspace/.claude → .claude-projects/<name> → .seed/base/{skills,prompts}`
- Reference architecture: your-platform.example.com (`apps/web/lib/auth/`, `apps/web/lib/eaas/db.ts`)
- Proven replacement: `~/.remote/@vendor-replacement/resonance` (Prisma+Clerk → pg+Auth.js)
